---
import Base from "../layouts/Base.astro";
import { Icon } from "astro-icon/components";
---

<Base
  title="首页"
  description="梅之夏博客的静态资源与说明站点。查阅 RSS 订阅方式、评论区图片存储说明和本站隐私政策。"
>
  <section class="hero">
    <div>
      <p class="eyebrow">
        <span class="dot"></span> 梅之夏博客 · 静态资源站
      </p>
      <h1>让有用的信息，<br />有一个<span>长久的住所。</span></h1>
      <p class="hero-description">
        这里收录梅之夏博客的订阅指引与相关说明。<br />
        简简单单，方便查阅，也方便下次再来。
      </p>
      <a class="button" href="/subscribe/"
        >订阅博客 RSS <span aria-hidden="true">↗</span></a
      >
      <a class="text-button" href="https://blog.mcenahle.page/"
        >去博客读文章 <Icon name="mdi:open-in-new" /></a
      >
    </div>
    <div class="hero-art" aria-hidden="true">
      <div class="orbit orbit-one"></div>
      <div class="orbit orbit-two"></div>
      <div class="flower">✳</div>
      <span class="art-caption">
        梅之夏<br />
        <small>一隅静处 / 一份长留</small>
      </span>
      <span class="art-number">M. / 01</span>
    </div>
  </section>
  <section class="resources" aria-labelledby="resource-title">
    <div class="section-title">
      <h2 id="resource-title">常用资源与说明</h2>
      <span>随时查阅 · 长期保留</span>
    </div>
    <div class="cards">
      <a class="card" href="/subscribe/">
        <div class="card-meta">
          <span>01 / 订阅</span><span aria-hidden="true">↗</span>
        </div>
        <span class="card-icon" aria-hidden="true">◔</span>
        <h3>把更新带到你的阅读器</h3>
        <p>了解 RSS，获取订阅地址，按自己的节奏阅读梅之夏博客。</p>
        <span class="card-action"
          >RSS 订阅指南 <span aria-hidden="true">→</span>
        </span></a
      >
      <a class="card" href="/comment-picture-save-policy/">
        <div class="card-meta">
          <span>02 / 说明</span>
          <span aria-hidden="true">↗</span>
        </div>
        <span class="card-icon" aria-hidden="true">▧</span>
        <h3>评论中的图片，存在哪里？</h3>
        <p>关于评论区图片的存储平台、长期保存、迁移与使用规则。</p>
        <span class="card-action"
          >图片存储说明 <span aria-hidden="true">→</span>
        </span></a
      >
      <a class="card" href="/privacy/">
        <div class="card-meta">
          <span>03 / 隐私</span>
          <span aria-hidden="true">↗</span>
        </div>
        <span class="card-icon" aria-hidden="true">◇</span>
        <h3>关于本站与你的数据</h3>
        <p>本站使用哪些技术，以及访问页面时涉及的数据处理。</p>
        <span class="card-action"
          >阅读隐私政策 <span aria-hidden="true">→</span>
        </span></a
      >
    </div>
  </section>
  <section class="home-note">
    <span class="eyebrow">关于这里</span>
    <p>
      文章在博客，说明在这里。<br />
      <span
        >这是「梅之夏博客」的静态资源站，主要承载长期存在、更新频率较低的内容。</span
      >
    </p>
    <a href="https://blog.mcenahle.page/"
      >blog.mcenahle.page <Icon name="mdi:open-in-new" /></a
    >
  </section>
</Base>
